!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-namespace-type-whose-size-bounds-cross-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7"
  description: "A namespace type's `min_items` above its `max_items` admits no value of any size, as a map type's does: the pair is the map's, and its coherence rule comes with it."
